OL,3,GNEWSAHow man went from stealing #1k a
OL,4,Aday to helping others
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former shoplifter who stole goods
OL,7,Fworth up to #1,000 a day to fuel his
OL,8,Fdrug addiction says his life has been
OL,9,Fturned around by a support scheme.
OL,11,FRhys Davies, from Dudley, said his
OL,12,Fissues with substance abuse began
OL,13,Fduring the Covid-19 pandemic when he
OL,14,Flost his ability to work and what had
OL,15,Fbeen social drug use became more
OL,16,Fserious.
OL,18,F"Life was very chaotic back then," he
OL,19,Fsaid. "Everything revolved around my
OL,20,Fdrug addiction."
