OL,3,GNEWSAHow man went from stealing #1k a
OL,4,Aday to helping others
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis dependence on Class A drugs led him
OL,7,Fto become, in his own words, a
OL,8,F"prolific offender" - but now he is one
OL,9,Fof hundreds of people across the West
OL,10,FMidlands to have benefitted from the
OL,11,FOffending 2 Recovery scheme.
